# Exact-match blocklist fixture, hosts format.
#
# Point VORTEX_BLOCKLIST_SOURCE at this file to start Vortex without the ~25s
# HTTP fetch of the real StevenBlack list. Every name below is under a domain
# RFC 2606 / RFC 6761 reserve for documentation and testing, so none of them can
# ever collide with a real lookup.
#
# The unit tests in src/blocklist/domain_blocklist.zig parse literals, not this
# file. It exists to be run against — by hand today, and by the P2.5 integration
# harness once that lands.

127.0.0.1 localhost
::1 localhost

0.0.0.0 ads.example.com
0.0.0.0 tracker.example.com
0.0.0.0 analytics.example.org
0.0.0.0 telemetry.example.net
0.0.0.0 blocked.test
